      "marks": 1,
      "question": "The value of $\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{1 - \\cos x \\cos 2x}{x^2}$ is",
      "options": [
        "1/2",
        "3/2",
        "5/2",
        "2"
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "(c) 5/2",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$1 - \\cos x \\cos 2x = 1 - \\cos x + \\cos x - \\cos x \\cos 2x$.",
        "$(1-\\cos x) + \\cos x(1-\\cos 2x)$.",
        "$\\frac{1-\\cos x}{x^2} + \\cos x \\frac{1-\\cos 2x}{x^2} \\to \\frac{1}{2} + 1 \\cdot \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{5}{2}$."
      ]
